     Strings for profiles: the Profiles tab, plus the per-app profile list
     and its create / rename / duplicate / delete actions in the Apps tab.

     RECONSTRUCTED 2026-08-19. Every value below is byte-exact from the r49
     Settings.apk resource table. Which res/values file this block
     originally lived in is NOT recoverable: aapt2 sorts string resources
     alphabetically, so the shipped public.xml carries no file-partition
     information. res/values/*.xml all merge, so the split is cosmetic; the
     names follow the strings_privacykit_<feature>.xml convention proven by
     the surviving _ai / _controls / _hub / _identifiers / _randomise files.
-->
<resources>
    <plurals name="privacykit_profile_count">
        <item quantity="other">%d profiles</item>
        <item quantity="one">%d profile</item>
    </plurals>
